Package: browserrenderer-mcp
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: browserrenderer-mcp maintainers <root@localhost>
Depends: nodejs (>= 18), chromium, fonts-liberation, ca-certificates, adduser, systemd
Section: web
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/microsoft/playwright-mcp
Description: Headless browser rendering over MCP (stock @playwright/mcp)
 Runs Microsoft's unmodified @playwright/mcp as a systemd service, bound to
 127.0.0.1 with a mandatory allowed-hosts check, intended to sit behind a
 reverse proxy or tunnel. Contains no custom MCP code.
